      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    par_value = 1000\n    annual_coupon_rate = 0.10\n    year_1_spot_rate = 0.06\n    year_1_forward_rate = 0.08\n    year_2_forward_rate = 0.10\n\n    annual_coupon = par_value * annual_coupon_rate\n\n    # Calculate discount factors from the spot and forward rates\n    discount_factor_1 = 1 / (1 + year_1_spot_rate)\n    discount_factor_2 = discount_factor_1 / (1 + year_1_forward_rate)\n    discount_factor_3 = discount_factor_2 / (1 + year_2_forward_rate)\n\n    # Calculate the bond value using the cash flows at the end of each year\n    bond_value = (\n        annual_coupon * discount_factor_1\n        + annual_coupon * discount_factor_2\n        + (annual_coupon + par_value) * discount_factor_3\n    )\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(bond_value, 3)\n```",
